  "answer": "I can't give you a Bitcoin price. My tools cover ABS and RBA data (including exchange rates for fiat currencies), and Bitcoin isn't among them.\n\nI can give you the input you'd need to convert it yourself. The RBA's latest AUD/USD rate is **0.6947 USD per A$1** (16 October 2026, 4pm AEST close). So:\n\n**Bitcoin in AUD = Bitcoin price in USD ÷ 0.6947**\n\nFor example, if one Bitcoin were US$100,000, it would be about A$143,950 at that rate. A Bitcoin exchange's live AUD price will be the most current figure, since crypto prices move far more than the exchange rate does over a day.",
